=== PARITY (web source reproduced end-to-end) ===
  The web FavoritesBar is a controlled, PRESENTATIONAL component (34 lines): its
  parent command center owns `favorites: string[]` + `commands: CommandDef[]` and
  passes a `renderTile` callback; it filters to favorited commands and returns
  `null` when none, else renders <FadeIn> wrapping a Star + uppercase "Quick
  Actions" label + (count) header over a 2/3/4-col grid of rendered tiles.
  - Data sources (web `useTranslation`): the only web hook is i18n; the favorites
    id-list + command registry are parent-owned props. The native surface binds
    them through the P1/S8 seam FavoritesSource→FavoritesBarModel (no view HTTP).
  - Composition: FadeIn (TSFadeIn) · Star → SF Symbol "star.fill" (amber
    statusWarning) · label → t('commands.cat.quickActions','Quick Actions') as
    TSLabel role, uppercased + tracked · count → "(N)" · grid → responsive
    LazyVGrid at the web Tailwind breakpoints (base 2 / sm≥640 → 3 / lg≥1024 → 4,
    measured via onGeometryChange; FavoritesLayout is pure + unit-tested) · tiles →
    caller-supplied `renderTile` (generic Tile param) with a production default
    FavoriteCommandTile (tinted icon chip + label/sublabel + filled favorite star
    that unpins + dangerous indicator; tap runs the command — web CommandTile).
  - States (ALL rendered — never a blank box; each has a #if DEBUG preview + an
    EXECUTED unit test):
      loading (redacted header + shimmer tile grid) · empty (resolved-but-empty →
      friendly ContentUnavailableView; web returns `null` here, native renders the
      prompt-mandated empty — documented deviation, not silent drift) · content
      (header + grid) · error (message + Retry) · stale (freshness chip + "favorites
      may be out of date" banner + one guarded auto-refresh) · offline (cached
      favorites kept + "showing your last saved favorites" banner + offline chip).
  - i18n (P1/S10): web keys preserved VERBATIM — commands.cat.quickActions ("Quick
    Actions") + commands.toggleFavorite ("Toggle favorite"); native chrome
    namespaced commands.favorites.* (loading/empty/emptyDescription/errorTitle/
    retry/live/stale/offline/staleBanner/offlineBanner/a11yNone/a11yCount). Every
    code-referenced key is declared in FavoritesBar.strings; NO English literals in
    native code (all via FavoritesStrings facade + Text(verbatim:)).
  - Accessibility: bar carries a combined VoiceOver summary ("Quick Actions: N
    favorites"); each tile is a labeled button; the favorite star + retry carry
    labels; icons are decorative (hidden); Dynamic-Type system fonts (Font.TS);
    reduce-motion honored (TSFadeIn + TSSkeleton).
  - Telemetry (P1/S11): FavoritesBarModel.start() emits view.opened with surface
    slug "FavoritesBar" exactly once (OSLogFavoritesTelemetry default; prod app
    injects the shared diagnostics adapter). Proven once-only by ModelTests.

